    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n7:02 am from Front Range Ave & Broadway\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n7:30 am from Greenbriar Blvd & Gillaspie Dr\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nBroadway & Pleasant St (#17892) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & University Ave (#12608) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Marine St (#25444) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Canyon Blvd (#12470) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Walnut St (#24252) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Spruce St (#12591) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Mapleton Ave (#12559) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Portland Pl (#12580) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & North St (#22998) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Alpine Ave (#12465) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Cedar Ave (#12492) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Elder Ave (#12513) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Forest Ave (#19385) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Grape Ave (#12534) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Hawthorn Ave (#33604) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Iris Ave (#12543) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Kalmia Ave (#12551) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Norwood Ave (#12569) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Poplar Ave (#12578) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Quince Ave (#12581) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Sumac Ave (#12601) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Violet Ave (#12612) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Yarmouth Ave (#12618) (northbound)\r\nBroadway & Lee Hill Dr (#22004) (northbound)\r\nLee Hill Rd & Broadway (#26096) (northbound)"
